,"layout":"vertical","gap":13,"children":[{"type":"text","id":"KZVyy","name":"Paragraph","fill":"#3E5A7D","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":"fill_container","content":"Banyak mahasiswa yang menghabiskan waktu belajar seharian di Gedung E, terutama saat mengerjakan tugas kelompok dan asistensi. Namun, colokan listrik yang tersedia saat ini hanya berada di beberapa titik di lobi lantai 1, sehingga mahasiswa kesulitan mengisi daya laptop dan ponsel.","lineHeight":1.8,"fontFamily":"$font-body","fontSize":13.5,"fontWeight":"normal"},{"type":"text","id":"U5HIS","name":"Paragraph","fill":"#3E5A7D","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":"fill_container","content":"Kami mengusulkan penambahan charging station di setiap lantai Gedung E, khususnya di koridor dekat area duduk dan ruang diskusi. Fasilitas ini dapat berupa meja kecil dengan 6–8 colokan listrik dan port USB, seperti yang sudah diterapkan di Gedung B.","lineHeight":1.8,"fontFamily":"$font-body","fontSize":13.5,"fontWeight":"normal"},{"type":"text","id":"QNsKF","name":"Paragraph","fill":"#3E5A7D","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":"fill_container","content":"Dengan adanya fasilitas ini, mahasiswa tidak perlu berpindah gedung hanya untuk mengisi daya perangkat, dan proses belajar di kampus menjadi lebih nyaman serta produktif.","lineHeight":1.8,"fontFamily":"$font-body","fontSize":13.5,"fontWeight":"normal"}]},{"type":"frame","id":"dRV6l","name":"Attachment Header","gap":8,"alignItems":"center","children":[{"type":"icon","id":"Qc2OZ","name":"Att Icon","width":14,"height":14,"icon":"paperclip","library":"lucide","fill":"$muted"},{"type":"text","id":"Pw39p","name":"Att Label","fill":"$muted","content":"Lampiran (2)","fontFamily":"$font-body","fontSize":12,"fontWeight":"700"}]},{"type":"frame","id":"yeFpX","name":"Attachments","width":"fill_container","gap":12,"alignItems":"center","children":[{"type":"frame","id":"Q7MLEO","name":"Attachment","fill":"$bg","cornerRadius":11,"stroke":"$border","strokeWidth":1,"gap":11,"paddi